            "translations": [
                {
                    "id": 4986,
                    "language": "en",
                    "description": "SQUASH FLEX",
                    "summary": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Want to know more about this membership? Check all info on </span><a href=\"https://uscsport.nl/en/sports/squash-3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">this squash page</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Flex\nmembership</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">A flexible membership that can be canceled monthly.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">First\npayment: pro rata</span><br>\n</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">When purchasing a\nyear or flex membership, you'll pay a pro rata amount.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Direct\ndebit</span><br>\n</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Subsequently, in\nthe first week of every month, a term will be collected by direct debit.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Canceling\nis simple</span><br>\n</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Send an e-mail to\nusc@uscsport.nl, or cancel your membership in your account in My USC. Your\nmembership will expire on the last day of that month. If you cancel a flex\nmembership in the same month as you purchased it, the membership will end on\nthe last day of the following month. There's always at least one full month's\npayment by direct debit before your flex membership ends.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Terms\nand conditions</span><br>\n</span></b><a href=\"https://www.uscsport.nl/en/about-the-usc/voorwaarden/\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">(Additional) terms and conditions</span></a><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">&nbsp;apply to all USC membership.\nBy purchasing a membership you agree to those terms and conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>",
                    "primaryPurchaseMessageDescription": null,
                    "secondaryPurchaseMessageDescription": null,
                    "productId": null,
                    "courseId": null,
                    "subscriptionId": 1472,
                    "productGroupId": null
                },
                {
                    "id": 4987,
                    "language": "nl",
                    "description": "SQUASH FLEX",
                    "summary": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Meer weten over dit abonnement? Check alle info op </span><a href=\"https://uscsport.nl/sport/squash/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">deze squashpagina</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Flexabonnement</span></b><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Een flexibel abonnement dat je maandelijks kunt opzeggen.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Eerste betaling: pro rata</span><br>\n</b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Bij aanschaf van een jaar- of flexabonnement betaal je een pro rata-bedrag.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Automatische incasso</span><br>\n</b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Vervolgens wordt in de eerste week van iedere maand een termijn\nafgeschreven via automatische incasso.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Opzeggen is simpel</span><br>\n</b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Mail naar usc@uscsport.nl, of beëindig je abonnement zelf in je account in\nMy USC. Je abonnement loopt dan af op de laatste dag van die maand. Zeg je je\nabonnement op in dezelfde maand als dat je het hebt aangeschaft, dan loopt het\nabonnement af op de laatste dag van de daaropvolgende maand. Er wordt dus\naltijd minimaal één keer een maandbedrag afgeschreven via automatische incasso,\nvoordat je flexabonnement afloopt.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Algemene voorwaarden</span><br>\n</b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Op alle USC-abonnementen zijn&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.uscsport.nl/over-usc/voorwaarden/\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">algemene (aanvullende)\nvoorwaarden</span></a><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">&nbsp;van toepassing. Bij aanschaf van een abonnement ga je\ndaarmee akkoord.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p></o:p></p>",
